# p-hover (h11-p-drag): the pointer settled on P (the bullseye at plane (2, 4),
# CSS (1028, 290) on the default x² at the default camera): the open hand
# (grab-hover), nothing lit (P has no onHover handler), no Q, P's label
# (2.00, 4.00) unchanged and no drop lines.
# A fresh page; the first move settles, then the final move lands on the
# fresh render (a 1 px nudge would leave a quantized Q behind).
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# cursor grab-hover; the lit line empty; no q line; the p line 2.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1029 291
wait 800
move 1028 290
wait 500
shot p-hover
